      <description>Texas Capital has retired its TCBI ticker and adopted TXCP, which Rob Holmes, chairman, president, and CEO of Texas Capital Bank Shares, said reflects the company’s Texas Capital brand and its evolution beyond banking. Holmes described a six-year transformation that created what he called the first full-service financial services firm in Texas. Holmes speaks with Vonnie Quinn &amp; Jess Menton on "The Close." (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
